OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's search for answers after
OL,4,Apolice custody death
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor nearly seven years Patricia Cameron
OL,7,Fhas fought to understand why her
OL,8,Fbrother died alone on the floor of a
OL,9,Fpolice cell.
OL,11,FWilliam Cameron, 38, died of a heart
OL,12,Fattack caused by a mix of alcohol,
OL,13,Fmethadone and other drugs.
OL,15,FOfficers in Reading, Berkshire,
OL,16,Fpresumed him to be "faking"
OL,17,Funconsciousness. That he was not sent
OL,18,Fto hospital has haunted his loved ones
OL,19,Fever since.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
